  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -30,
        -26
      ],
      "id": 16,
      "text": "ATmega8A at the factory clock (internal RC, 1 MHz) with avr_serial: the USART at 9600 baud.\nRun (F5) and open the terminal (USART): it greets; type to see the echo, l toggles the LED on PB0,\n? prints how many bytes arrived. The count lives in the EEPROM: save the project, and it survives\nstop, start and reopening (U1-eeprom.bin beside the project)."
    }
  ],
